            { text: "Therefore each of the figures {A|At} and {B|Bt} is equiangular with {C|Ct}",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["At","Bt","Ct"] },
            { text: "and with {C|Ct} has the sides about the equal angles proportional,",
